{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "MCP Search Preparation",
  "description": "Reads trace_format.md and search_strategy.md before performing MCP file searches to ensure proper methodology",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "promptSubmit"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "在使用MCP搜索文件之前，请先阅读 trace_format.md 和 search_strategy.md 文件，理解要搜索的trace格式和搜索的策略，然后基于这些指导原则思考如何进行下一步的搜索操作。在每一轮的搜索后要总结并复盘计算逻辑，并用python还原，猜测后一定要进行算法验证"
  }
}